@AndroDevcd Zep currently serializes additions to a graph to ensure temporal integrity. Conversational messages typically get ingested within a minute. We recommend including recent chat messages in the prompt as short-term memory in order to address this latency.

At scale, you'd have many users, each with their own graphs, with messages to each graph being processed concurrently.

